'''100M DL Celebration''' (1億DL記念ガチャ, ''Ichioku Daunrōdo Kinen Gacha'', '''100 Million Download Celebration Gacha''') was a special type of [[Cat Capsule]] added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]]. For this gacha, the player needed a special ticket that could be obtained from a limited time sale. It only contained limited Uber Rare units from [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] and [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] in addition to non-collaboration Legend Rares, and it was guaranteed to drop an Uber Rare or a Legend Rare at a 50% chance each.

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 50%
|SuperChance = 0%
|RareChance = 0%
|LegendChance = 50%
}}

